---
---

<section style="
  padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2D6A4F 0%, #1e4d38 100%);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
">
  <!-- Decorative orbiting circles -->
  <div style="
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%; left: 50%;
    width: 0; height: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  " aria-hidden="true">
    <div style="
      position: absolute;
      width: 18px; height: 18px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255, 209, 102, 0.25);
      animation: orbitCircle 14s linear infinite;
      margin: -9px;
    "></div>
    <div style="
      position: absolute;
      width: 12px; height: 12px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(82, 183, 136, 0.3);
      animation: orbitCircle 20s linear infinite reverse;
      margin: -6px;
    "></div>
  </div>

  <div style="
    position: absolute;
    top: -80px; right: -80px;
    width: 300px; height: 300px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    animation: spinSlow 30s linear infinite;
    pointer-events: none;
  " aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div style="
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -60px; left: -60px;
    width: 200px; height: 200px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    animation: spinSlow 22s linear infinite reverse;
    pointer-events: none;
  " aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- Small floating dots -->
  <div style="position: absolute; top: 20%; left: 8%; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,209,102,0.4); animation: float 5s ease-in-out infinite;" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div style="position: absolute; top: 70%; right: 10%; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(82,183,136,0.35); animation: float 7s ease-in-out infinite 1s;" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div style="position: absolute; top: 40%; right: 5%; width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite 2s;" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">

    <!-- Quote icon -->
    <div data-animate="scale" style="margin: 0 auto 1.5rem; width: fit-content;">
      <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.2)" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M3 21c3 0 7-1 7-8V5c0-1.25-.756-2.017-2-2H4c-1.25 0-2 .75-2 1.972V11c0 1.25.75 2 2 2 1 0 1 0 1 1v1c0 1-1 2-2 2s-1 .008-1 1.031V20c0 1 0 1 1 1z"/>
        <path d="M15 21c3 0 7-1 7-8V5c0-1.25-.757-2.017-2-2h-4c-1.25 0-2 .75-2 1.972V11c0 1.25.75 2 2 2h.75c0 2.25.25 4-2.75 4v3c0 1 0 1 1 1z"/>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <blockquote data-animate style="margin: 0;">
      <p style="
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: clamp(1.375rem, 3vw, 1.875rem);
        font-weight: 400;
        font-style: italic;
        color: #fff;
        line-height: 1.45;
        margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
      ">
        "If you want to go fast, go alone. If you want to go far, go together."
      </p>
      <footer style="font-size: 0.9375rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);">
        — The guiding principle behind Happy Green World
      </footer>
    </blockquote>

    <!-- Animated accent line -->
    <div data-animate style="margin: 2rem auto; width: fit-content;">
      <div class="mission-line" style="
        height: 2px;
        width: 60px;
        background: var(--color-accent);
      "></div>
    </div>

    <p data-animate style="
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin: 0;
    ">
      We do not inherit the earth from our ancestors — we borrow it from our children. Happy Green World exists to ensure the next generation receives the knowledge and tools to be responsible stewards of the world they will inherit.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .is-visible .mission-line,
  [data-animate].is-visible + div .mission-line {
    animation: growWidth 0.6s ease forwards;
  }
</style>
